1
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,400
<v Claire>What are we going to do?

2
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,450
<v Chris>Okay. Turn the key clockwise simultaneously on three.

3
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,500
<v Claire>Got it.

4
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:40,300
<v Chris>One, two, three!

5
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,800
<v Computer>Initiating energy injection.

6
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:55,900
<v Computer>Warning. The safety box will not be released until charging is complete.

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,200
<v Chris>I'll keep her busy! Just go for the emergency elevator!

8
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,250
<v Claire>Chris, but...

9
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:09,000
<v Chris>I can take care of this! Just go!

10
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,800
<v Claire>You have to make it! Don't die on me!

